    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the rule of reading speaks of "any reference to a section"; another kind of reference is not covered

DECLARE `o 47 r 1(1) the power exercised by the Comptroller` IS ONE OF
    `o 47 r 1(1) a power under section 65`
    `o 47 r 1(1) a power under section 65A`
    `o 47 r 1(1) a power under section 65B`
