-- COVERS O 47 r 1(1) “proceedings to which this Order applies”
-- src:6179 | “proceedings to which this Order applies” means any proceedings to review the exercise by the Comptroller of any power under section 65, 65A or 65B to obtain information for the purposes of complying with a request made under section 105D(1) and any application relating to such proceedings;
@ref O 47 r 1(1) “proceedings to which this Order applies” (src:6179)
GIVEN `the proceedings are to review the exercise by the Comptroller of a power to obtain information` IS A BOOLEAN
      power IS A `o 47 r 1(1) the power exercised by the Comptroller`
      `the information was to be obtained for the purposes of complying with a request made under section 105D(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the proceedings are an application relating to such proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 47 r 1(1) proceedings are proceedings to which this Order applies` MEANS
    IF     (    `the proceedings are to review the exercise by the Comptroller of a power to obtain information`
            AND (   power EQUALS `o 47 r 1(1) a power under section 65`
                 OR power EQUALS `o 47 r 1(1) a power under section 65A`
                 OR power EQUALS `o 47 r 1(1) a power under section 65B`)
            AND `the information was to be obtained for the purposes of complying with a request made under section 105D(1)`)
        OR `the proceedings are an application relating to such proceedings`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“proceedings to which this Order applies” means any proceedings to review the exercise by the Comptroller of any power under section 65, 65A or 65B ... and any application relating to such proceedings"

-- COVERS O 47 r 1(1) “subject request”
