@ref O 47 r 5(2) (src:6206-6211)
GIVEN person IS A `o 47 r 5(2) the person to be served`
      `the person is the applicant` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the application and supporting affidavit were filed and served on the person` IS A DATE
      `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
